0,0,0,0.25);position:relative;z-index:1;border:3px solid #FFFFFF\">\n\n  <div style=\"margin:14px 0 0;background:transparent;border-radius:14px;padding:12px 16px;position:relative;z-index:3\">\n    <p data-slot=\"period\" style=\"margin:0 0 8px;display:inline-block;padding:5px 16px;font-size:14px;color:#1A5E00;background:#C8F060;border-radius:999px;border:2px solid #6AAD20;font-weight:700\">평일 11시~14시 한정</p>\n    <p data-slot=\"discount\" style=\"margin:0;font-size:26px;font-weight:800;color:#D43000;text-shadow:1px 1px 0 #FF8C00\">★ 런치 세트 20% 할인</p>\n  </div>\n\n</div>','하단 정보 박스 배경을 투명하게 수정했습니다.','2026-10-23 16:42:50.936659','2026-10-23 16:42:50.936659','2026-10-23 16:43:24.113813');
